ing: Villa Community</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/hotel-resort-landscape/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Hotel &#038; Resort Landscape BIM</b><span>Abu Dhabi</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 400</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/public-park-and-recreational-landscape-bim/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Public Park &#038; Recreational Landscape BIM</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/commercial-and-retail-landscape-bim/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Commercial &#038; Retail Landscape BIM</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/infrastructure-landscape-and-streetscape-bim/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Infrastructure Landscape &#038; Streetscape BIM</b><span>UAE</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li></ul>\n</div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Delivery workflow</p><h2 class=\"h2\">How BIM Modeling <em>runs.</em></h2></div><p class=\"lead\">Five stages, with QA/QC before anything is issued.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"flow f5\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Scope &amp; BEP</h3><p>Confirm deliverables, LOD/LOI matrix and standards.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Template setup</h3><p>Templates, shared parameters, worksets and shared coordinates prepared to your BEP.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Modelling</h3><p>Discipline models built element by element to the LOD/LOI matrix, then cross-checked.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>04</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">QA/QC</h3><p>Run model health, standards and clash checks before issue.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>05</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Issue</h3><p>Native RVT and IFC issued through the agreed CDE with a revision log.</p></div></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"p